{"task_id": "Mbpp/414", "solution": "def overlapping(seq1, seq2):\n    \"\"\"Return True if any element in seq1 exists in seq2; otherwise False.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        seq2_set = set(seq2)\n    except TypeError:\n        # Fall back to nested iteration if elements are unhashable.\n        for a in seq1:\n            for b in seq2:\n                if a == b:\n                    return True\n        return False\n    for a in seq1:\n        if a in seq2_set:\n            return True\n    return False"}
